      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a matcher that includes additional paths under a <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a>\nfor the specified <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个匹配器，包含指定<a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>下的<code>WebServerNamespace</code><a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\">。</a>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a matcher that includes the specified <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含指定<a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>的匹配器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a matcher that matches only on the links endpoint. It can be used when\nsecurity configuration for the links endpoint is different from the other\n<a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>. The\n<a href=\"EndpointRequest.EndpointServerWebExchangeMatcher.html#excludingLinks()\"><code>excludingLinks</code></a> method can\nbe used in combination with this to remove the links endpoint from\n<a href=\"#toAnyEndpoint()\"><code>toAnyEndpoint</code></a>. For example:\n<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toLinks()\n</pre>",
      "translation": "返回一个仅匹配链接端点的匹配器。当链接端点的安全配置与其他 <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a> 不同时，可以使用它。<a href=\"EndpointRequest.EndpointServerWebExchangeMatcher.html#excludingLinks()\"><code>excludingLinks</code></a> 方法可以与该匹配器结合使用，以从 <a href=\"#toAnyEndpoint()\"><code>toAnyEndpoint</code></a> 中移除链接端点。例如：\n<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toLinks()\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a matcher that includes all <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>. It also\nincludes the links endpoint which is present at the base path of the actuator\nendpoints. The <a href=\"EndpointRequest.EndpointServerWebExchangeMatcher.html#excluding(java.lang.Class...)\"><code>excluding</code></a> method can be used to further remove specific endpoints if required. For\nexample: <pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toAnyEndpoint().excluding(ShutdownEndpoint.class)\n</pre>",
      "translation": "返回一个包含所有<a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>的匹配器。它还包含位于 actuator 端点基础路径上的 links 端点。如果需要，可以使用<a href=\"EndpointRequest.EndpointServerWebExchangeMatcher.html#excluding(java.lang.Class...)\"><code>excluding</code></a>方法进一步移除特定端点。例如：<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toAnyEndpoint().excluding(ShutdownEndpoint.class)\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a matcher that includes additional paths under a <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a>\nfor the specified <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>. For example:\n<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toAdditionalPaths(WebServerNamespace.SERVER, \"health\")\n</pre>",
      "translation": "返回一个包含指定 <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a> 下 <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a> 的额外路径的匹配器。例如：\n<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toAdditionalPaths(WebServerNamespace.SERVER, \"health\")\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a matcher that includes additional paths under a <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a>\nfor the specified <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a>. For example:\n<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toAdditionalPaths(WebServerNamespace.SERVER, HealthEndpoint.class)\n</pre>",
      "translation": "返回一个包含指定 <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/annotation/Endpoint.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation\"><code>actuator endpoints</code></a> 下 <a href=\"../../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a> 的额外路径的匹配器。例如：\n<pre class=\"code\">EndpointRequest.toAdditionalPaths(WebServerNamespace.SERVER, HealthEndpoint.class)\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
